<h2 id="maintenance">Maintaining complete coverage</h2>

On an upgrade, compare source registries before changing counts. Add or retire an entry with its exact source evidence, canonical design owner and a meaningful specimen. Retain explicit aliases while the native source supports them. Review changes to capabilities and semantics even when the key itself is unchanged. A renamed file is not automatically a new public feature.

The JSON records source paths, immutable commits, hashes, index members, extraction methods, expected identifiers and mappings. Its reference-only status must not be promoted by a successful documentation build. Store native browser/live-device evidence separately, including version, scenario, outcome and limitation. Review owner: civica maintainers.
